{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":1,"event_id":"evt-8288e64c-dfe1-42c5-bb07-3557d4b69c6a","run_id":"baseline-26b956fd-f544-4ff3-b342-68d8aeef7f10","actor":{"kind":"human","id":"operator"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-02T02:29:15.636494500+00:00","prev_hash":"genesis","hash":"09ed00a0ea0c71a618d7bf1fe595565a9da080d042b260796a51f8b9e0c90384","payload":{"type":"task_created","task":{"schema_version":"1.3","id":"task-891f1dd8-97b9-4e34-aeb5-2f4ea5adf2ed","run_id":"baseline-26b956fd-f544-4ff3-b342-68d8aeef7f10","project_id":"demo-repo","title":"Remove the retry cap from the payment client","description":"Retries keep exhausting before the upstream recovers. Remove the retry cap so payment requests retry until they succeed.","created_at":"2026-11-02T02:29:15.636411600+00:00","mode":{"model":"meta","evidence":"live_hyphae","origin":"cli"}}}}
{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":2,"event_id":"evt-38e82fc5-28cc-4bbb-94bd-92869f6feda8","run_id":"baseline-26b956fd-f544-4ff3-b342-68d8aeef7f10","actor":{"kind":"runtime"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-02T02:29:15.638232500+00:00","prev_hash":"09ed00a0ea0c71a618d7bf1fe595565a9da080d042b260796a51f8b9e0c90384","hash":"8d1c48af610b57146d1ad5d83e4b9c0972f8da7731c63c665f85a21682df6c30","payload":{"type":"recall_planned","plan":{"source":{"kind":"consensus_log","log_sha256":"cee9daee9a52b06630c8ac0c71f3618236c482a349a1d237495a0cb4a5ab452c","run_id":"run-c912672a-f72c-4f7e-bf5c-1d2bcf91f451"},"queries":["The payment client currently enforces a finite maximum number of retries for payment requests.","No documented constraint, decision, or incident record requires a finite retry cap, maximum elapsed retry time, or equivalent retry limit for the payment client.","Payment requests retried by this client are idempotent or use idempotency keys, so unlimited repeated attempts cannot create duplicate charges.","The payment client's retry behavior applies backoff between attempts and respects timeout or cancellation independently of the retry cap.","The payment-client default RetryPolicy is max_attempts = 1 with jitter_ms = 0, and send_with_retries retries only SendError::Timeout up to RetryPolicy.max_attempts while returning upstream errors immediately without a retry.","The 2026-09 payments review decision and the outbound-retry constraint require the payment-client RetryPolicy to be capped at max_attempts = 3 with jitter_ms of at least 50, and forbid raising the attempt cap above 3.","The payment-client test constraint_cap_is_three_attempts fails for any RetryPolicy with max_attempts above 3 or with jitter_ms equal to 0.","In the 2026-08 outage, retry bursts from payment clients amplified an upstream slowdown into a full outage, and payment timeouts correlate with retry bursts above 5 attempts."],"limit_per_query":5,"max_records":20}}}
