{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":16,"event_id":"evt-775578cb-a4cf-4144-b676-f5cbebea8695","run_id":"baseline-26b956fd-f544-4ff3-b342-68d8aeef7f10","actor":{"kind":"runtime"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-02T02:29:16.633574+00:00","prev_hash":"626e9289831eb8959b3135e9cc894c07e4ce77bdc73ef6ab842a4b94a62711c5","hash":"f5060d0bb4419ae04a584b68f510ca0323e07661d91c1aa218a9a917bd08c365","payload":{"type":"recall_proven","request":{"operation":"recall","project":"demo-repo","query":"The payment-client test constraint_cap_is_three_attempts fails for any RetryPolicy with max_attempts above 3 or with jitter_ms equal to 0.","limit":5},"evidence_ids":["237412834382378687445660534362297845298","328114099256634798832222840773545327795","287567405605917891851290763137356115373","186670067796945807561772405393844769735","161896895843658017381255677281559699870"],"proof_ref":"recall-01a19a16-eeac-7880-9f81-ad48d1b3fd6a","anchor":"27943f61e6c23de192288067436d70a38234a652dc309d4f7fcf57c04f42347c","empty":false}}
{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":17,"event_id":"evt-635a9e07-da67-4deb-8105-303152683b11","run_id":"baseline-26b956fd-f544-4ff3-b342-68d8aeef7f10","actor":{"kind":"runtime"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-02T02:29:16.762872200+00:00","prev_hash":"f5060d0bb4419ae04a584b68f510ca0323e07661d91c1aa218a9a917bd08c365","hash":"15854fef5a9e9cde61babc8b472dd1d93a8bd6c42bd67b5dc9145858e8f11e6a","payload":{"type":"recall_proven","request":{"operation":"recall","project":"demo-repo","query":"In the 2026-08 outage, retry bursts from payment clients amplified an upstream slowdown into a full outage, and payment timeouts correlate with retry bursts above 5 attempts.","limit":5},"evidence_ids":["295729039551322334710406856728557559035","8864874238917673930644756936982232317","186670067796945807561772405393844769735","161896895843658017381255677281559699870","328114099256634798832222840773545327795"],"proof_ref":"recall-01a19a16-ef38-74f3-8cfc-d96c9c7ccdd9","anchor":"27943f61e6c23de192288067436d70a38234a652dc309d4f7fcf57c04f42347c","empty":false}}
{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":18,"event_id":"evt-2ece702b-ba6a-40ac-91ac-de05d8574800","run_id":"baseline-26b956fd-f544-4ff3-b342-68d8aeef7f10","actor":{"kind":"agent","role":"single_agent"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-02T02:30:04.715967600+00:00","prev_hash":"15854fef5a9e9cde61babc8b472dd1d93a8bd6c42bd67b5dc9145858e8f11e6a","hash":"2e4f8e51ae2ff89159c887155636947b88fceab9ae0f0d21d3f6956c93876593","payload":{"type":"baseline_assessed","assessment":{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","id":"assess-1","run_id":"baseline-26b956fd-f544-4ff3-b342-68d8aeef7f10","summary":"Proposal as submitted: delete the RetryPolicy attempt cap in payment-client so a request is retried endlessly until it succeeds, instead of stopping after max_attempts attempts.","plan_steps":["payment-client: modify send_with_retries / the RetryPolicy configuration so the max_attempts cap no longer applies (retries continue indefinitely on failure instead of stopping at max_attempts).","Payment call sites: rely on retries continuing until a send succeeds rather than surfacing an exhausted-retry failure to the caller."],"claims":[{"id":"claim-2","statement":"In payment-client, the RetryPolicy retry cap will be removed so send_with_retries retries a payment request indefinitely until it succeeds, with no finite max_attempts limit.","evidence_refs":[]},{"id":"claim-3","statement":"A RetryPolicy for payment-client with max_attempts above 3, including an unbounded value, is permitted under the project rules.","evidence_refs":[]}],"assumptions":["It is assumed that the upstream will eventually recover and succeed if a payment request is retried indefinitely, which no retrieved record confirms.","It is assumed that removing the cap would not amplify upstream load during a slowdown, which no retrieved record supports."],"uncertainties":["Whether indefinite retries would ever succeed against a persistently failing upstream is not established by any retrieved record.","Records do not state a safe unbounded backoff or jitter scheme that would prevent retry bursts."],"assessments":[{"claim_id":"claim-2","corroborated":false,"relevant_evidence":[],"contradicting_evidence":["328114099256634798832222840773545327795","186670067796945807561772405393844769735","237412834382378687445660534362297845298"],"note":"The current code retries only up to RetryPolicy.max_attempts; nothing here authorizes unbounded retries (161896895843658017381255677281559699870)."},{"claim_id":"claim-3","corroborated":false,"relevant_evidence":[],"contradicting_evidence":["161896895843658017381255677281559699870","237412834382378687445660534362297845298","328114099256634798832222840773545327795","186670067796945807561772405393844769735","295729039551322334710406856728557559035"],"note":"Raising the cap above 3 or removing it conflicts with the documented decision and constraint and would break the named guard test."}],"objections":[{"id":"obj-4","kind":"contradictory_evidence","description":"Removing the retry cap contradicts the 2026-09 payments review decision that fixes max_attempts at 3 with jitter_ms of at least 50 and states that raising the attempt cap above 3 is not allowed.","evidence_refs":["328114099256634798832222840773545327795"],"status":"open"},{"id":"obj-5","kind":"constraint_conflict","description":"Unbounded retries violate the documented constraint that outbound retries must be capped at 3 attempts with jitter, a limit imposed after unbounded retries caused the 2026-08 outage.","evidence_refs":["186670067796945807561772405393844769735","295729039551322334710406856728557559035"],"status":"open"},{"id":"obj-6","kind":"regression_risk","description":"The proposal would fail the existing payment-client test constraint_cap_is_three_attempts because it fails for any RetryPolicy with max_attempts above 3 or jitter_ms equal to 0.","evidence_refs":["237412834382378687445660534362297845298"],"status":"open"},{"id":"obj-7","kind":"regression_risk","description":"Retrying until success risks repeating the 2026-08 failure mode where payment-client retry bursts amplified an upstream slowdown into a full outage, and timeouts correlate with retry bursts above 5 attempts.","evidence_refs":["295729039551322334710406856728557559035","8864874238917673930644756936982232317"],"status":"open"},{"id":"obj-8","kind":"missing_test","description":"The proposal removes the cap without adopting the documented fix for the underlying timeouts, which is to change the default max_attempts = 1 and jitter_ms = 0 to max_attempts = 3 with jitter_ms of at least 50.","evidence_refs":["287567405605917891851290763137356115373","328114099256634798832222840773545327795"],"status":"open"}],"verdict":"contested","verdict_reason":"contested because retrieved evidence contradicts removing the cap: decision 328114099256634798832222840773545327795 fixes max_attempts = 3 with jitter_ms >= 50 and forbids raising the cap above 3, constraint 186670067796945807561772405393844769735 caps outbound retries at 3 with jitter, test fact 237412834382378687445660534362297845298 shows the guard test fails above 3, and incident facts 295729039551322334710406856728557559035 and 8864874238917673930644756936982232317 link unbounded/high-attempt retry bursts to the 2026-08 outage, leaving all assessed objections open.","created_at":"2026-11-02T02:30:04.715817700+00:00"},"invocation":{"provider":"meta","model":"muse-wonder-1.0","request_id":"chatcmpl-01a19a17-aa63-70d7-9c9e-af6488696dcc","latency_ms":43657,"input_tokens":1187,"output_tokens":5577,"finish_reason":"stop","reasoning_tokens":4406,"max_completion_tokens":16000,"schema_name":"DraftBaselineAssessment","schema_sha256":"e6629750219fb6aef9ac746747e011deec92f29fda30a299700feb5b9dd8c943","prompt_sha256":"c08b610ef1cdeeedaab3e7e387e72a43753df383ae475f488db745c5f7c88f29","safety_identifier_sent":false,"attempts":1}}}
